"""Shared HTML shell for the ETF charts: palette, CSS, JS, and page assembler.

Split out of viz.py so each module stays small; viz.py builds the SVG marks and
imports document() + the formatters from here. The generated page is fully
self-contained (inline CSS/JS, no external assets).

XSS-safe by construction: dynamic tooltip nodes are built with DOM textContent
(never innerHTML), and the embedded JSON escapes < > & (plus JS line separators)
so a free-text holding name containing </script> cannot break out of the inline
<script> block while staying valid JSON.
"""

